    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateThreatModel@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic threat model for the objective-to-release path. Actors, assets, trust boundaries, state owners, canonicalization, CIDs, events, leases, fences, unknown outcomes, confirmations, proof admission, dependencies, and builds are bounded. Twenty-four threats cover every trusted-path stage from objective submission through release decision. Pack CID bafkreih72d3nncekez43wmtlczq5mdtymzniluujypwybpgu3mtt7i4v2e, current-root CID bafkreihjdjarrlr24sperlq3zl4hjrksbol4b5saxquie3wpyi6xwsobwi, chain CID baguqeeraeuvfodvledfa4nvfuso6eyyytzk2acptcogzwzyarkdinpqcsdfq, objective CID baguqeeraynsn7tjr3iaggnreylzxo3akaooqwp5bf5oheaa6eubth2zwqeba, idea digest baguqeeracbayojdov4jmqiirx22pavrg6nabazcocru6y3scrdx5e54mw2zq, Python client CID baguqeerat346yf4k7kenbqlbtyejeilgxamna262z3axzjjatzm2hccehblq, MCP client CID baguqeerasdkirdryda7uoi5gchsyhuyvh6d2uremm45zpob7hoss3ao66ahq, parity CID baguqeera6y3w7bhzy6hpo6ohfsrj5xihrw5vk6qqljjonjrupijd2yrp3hnq, and PCPR-083 bypass proof CID baguqeeraepx7iiqcc4gtfp63kpozlkdd2qg3px3ptnqhj3rpigqtemjc5psa are bound and not reminted. Replaying the same threat-model command yields model CID baguqeera2kz3zj4stztmb22lmbcuyj3zj2ekdg7st2qzefbr5z6r6vemnhxq and is rejected as a duplicate effect. DatasetsThreatModelBinding@1 and KitThreatModelBinding@1 consume the Accelerate model without reminting pack, current-root, chain, objective, protocol, client, parity, or bypass identities. Trusted-computing-base inventory remains PCPR-091. Audit package remains PCPR-092. Closed release decision remains PCPR-093/094. Live Supervisor.run, live Quack, live MCP, and live CLI stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-090-operator-live-threat-model. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
